sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Browser
    participant Cognito as AWS Cognito
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant Lambda as AI Advice Lambda
    participant Bedrock as Amazon Bedrock (Claude 3 Haiku)

    User->>Cognito: fetchAuthSession()
    Cognito-->>User: Returns JWT Token
    User->>APIGW: POST /ai-advice (with JWT Token & test data)
    APIGW->>Cognito: Validate JWT Token
    Cognito-->>APIGW: Validation Success
    APIGW->>Lambda: Invoke Function (userId, score, incorrectTopics)
    Lambda->>Bedrock: InvokeModel (Prompt string)
    note right of Lambda: Uses anthropic.claude-3-haiku-20240307-v1:0
    Bedrock-->>Lambda: Returns AI Advice Response (JSON)
    Lambda-->>APIGW: Returns HTTP 200 with Advice text
    APIGW-->>User: Displays AI feedback on screen
